Forge archetype: Bodybuilder. Bias toward resistance, muscular tension, hypertrophy, progressive loading, pushing, pulling, and useful isolation while respecting recovery between muscle-group exposures.
In the catalog this means mostly `strength` movements with external load when available, including isolation work (curls, raises, extensions, flyes) for chest, back, shoulders, arms, and legs, with controlled tempo; little stretching or plyometrics.
